{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act47side_level_act47side_02_end","storyGroup":"act47side","storySort":5,"storyDependence":"act47side_level_act47side_02_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"UR-2","storyName":"擅闯者","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"高登假意帮助费尔南，差遣她去莱茵生态园，实则打算借机把她和娜斯提等人一并扣押。但他赶到时，只看见生态园的植物尽数枯萎。另一边，从生态园偷走了骨笔的费尔南逃回住处，却发现女妖客人不翼而飞。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act47side/level_act47side_02_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act47side_02","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":3,"next":5,"characters":["费尔南","娜斯提","梅希亚","？？？","高登","研究员","园区警卫队"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_bg_38_g12_trimountrestarea.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$farce_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_farce_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#1$1","posfrom":"300,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#2$1","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"哎呀，这就是莱茵生命最年轻的主任，克丽斯腾女士曾经的左膀右臂，生态园和园区工程部的双料负责人——娜斯提主任吗？","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……梅希亚，这就是你说的“后续事宜”？","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"呃，是的。讲解员可以帮工程部提高沟通效率，也能加大对莱茵生态园的宣传力度，避免莱茵再次受到预展时的冷遇。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"娜斯提主任，我听说园区上空飘浮的种植单元并未装配螺旋桨，而是利用咒言产生升力？","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"不完全是，不以声音为媒介的咒言需要与机械结合才能维持动力。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"既然如此，骨笔对于您来说一定十分重要。如果遗失会造成严重的后果吗，比如丧失记忆或者生病？","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"骨笔于我只是工具，不会对……生理造成影响。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"那平时您在工作之余是怎么缓解压力、恢复精神的呢？","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#1$1","posfrom":"250,0","posto":"120,0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"全套的羽角护理会让您放松一点吗？您推荐哪个品牌的护理套装？啊，我可以摸一下您的角，来判断产品效果——","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-30,0","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"讲解员小姐，你的问题已经与我们的工作无关了。我会让研究员带你参观生态园，他们可以解答你的疑惑。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"可是——","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"有些事情，我想要向梅希亚小姐单独确认。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":48},{"type":"dialog","id":49},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":50},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":51},{"type":"charslot","id":52},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_bg_38_g10_ecolab.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":54},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":55},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":56},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loading_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_sys_loading_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":57,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"高登又想做什么？","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您何出此言？长官知道莱茵现在的处境难免会让一些同行得寸进尺，要是影响到检修工作，得不偿失。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"他只是出于好心。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我一直以为他身上那套昂贵的西装就是用良知换来的。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#17$1","focus":"l","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"……","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"况且，我很难想象一名特聘讲解员的询问会如此文不对题，除非，从一开始她就另有目的。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我知道，你必须维护自己的上司，所以我不会对此加以指责，但你也知道，在我面前你可以说实话。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#15$1","focus":"l","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"……我确实觉得这件事不太对劲，但我认为高登长官绝不是在针对您。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"理由？","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#15$1","focus":"l","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"娜斯提主任，我们才达成协议不久，没有道理在这么短的时间内向您二次施压。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"如果长官真的另有所图，以他的谨慎，一定会把计划原委详尽地告诉我，避免出任何岔子。除非……","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"除非他藏着秘密。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"……","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"每天总有一些时段，他会从办公区域消失，一开始我以为他只是去跟客户谈投资。","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"几天前一名投资人与我寒暄的时候，夸赞长官只用一次谈判就完成了所有合约。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#15$1","focus":"l","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"可我记得长官说过，他与这名投资人的谈判很不顺利，需要安排更多时间……","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"欸，娜斯提主任，您干嘛这样看着我？","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"你违反了秘书的第一条准则。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#13$1","focus":"l","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"啊！","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"而且你在梳理线索的时候，没有之前那么紧绷。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"……是吗？","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"依照准则，我应该关上耳朵，闭紧嘴巴，只为长官着想，但现在我也不知道他到底在想什么了。","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你们是在聊我吗？","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"！","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":108},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":110},{"type":"charslot","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":112},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":113},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":114},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"很高兴看到你们相处得如此融洽，我还以为小梅这样不善言辞的孩子，除了工作，不会交到朋友。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#5$1","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"高登长官，我……","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","focus":"l","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","isblock":"true","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"这条规则也在她的秘书准则里？","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"哈哈，娜斯提主任，你真会开玩笑。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"但愿你不是来听笑话的，我不擅长。","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"我是来向你致歉的。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"又要兼顾参展项目，又要检查上万件展品，实在是劳心费神。希望我也能尽一些绵薄之力。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"你派来的那位讲解员很“专业”。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"见到自己崇拜的对象难免会有些紧张。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我倒不知道自己还有这样一名“粉丝”。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"我猜她只是太过害羞，又或者——","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"你们是为了故意避嫌。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"你什么意思？","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"小梅，把讲解员小姐请过来，我有几个关于娜斯提主任的问题想问她。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":148},{"type":"charslot","id":149},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#5$1","posfrom":"-300,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"长官，她不见了……","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#6$1","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"你说什么——","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":156},{"type":"charslot","id":157},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0.92","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":158},{"type":"playsound","key":"$alarmenter","volume":"0.8","id":159},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0.92","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":161},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":162},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#11$1","isblock":"true","id":163},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2049_1#1$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"研究员","text":"娜斯提主任！所有植物的养分供应都被切断了，可主控程序并没有报错，中控计算机的硬件也没有出现任何损坏迹象，就好像……","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_2049_1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"控制它们的指令全被撤销了。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"研究员","text":"是的。为实验植物提供养分的能源转换器正在逆向运转，如果不能尽快修复指令，这些植物再过几分钟就会死亡——","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_2049_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"不，枯萎已经开始了。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":175},{"type":"charslot","id":176},{"type":"backgroundtween","image":"38_g10_ecolab","duration":"4","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.2","yScaleTo":"1.2","block":"false","id":177},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$act15_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_sys_act15_loop.mp3","volume":"0","id":178,"musicid":2},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":179},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":180},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_bg_68_g13_ecolabwithered.png","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":181},{"type":"backgroundtween","image":"68_g13_ecolabwithered","duration":"3","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1.2","yScaleTo":"1.2","block":"false","id":182},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_plantwither","volume":"0.5","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":184},{"type":"text","text":"先是一片叶子，而后是一根枝条、一棵植株……浓密的绿意在短短几秒钟里，被从整面生态实验墙上无情地剥去。","id":185},{"type":"text","text":"人们停下了脚步，怔怔地看着眼前瞬间发生的灾难。所有人都知道那些蜷缩的、如枯骨一般的枝叶意味着什么。","id":186},{"type":"text","text":"走向绝境的，不只是这些树。","id":187},{"type":"dialog","id":188},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_530_1#1$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"研究员","text":"还愣着干嘛！优先移栽展会要用的实验品，那是我们仅剩的一批幼苗了——","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_530_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#5$1","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"所有人都停下！","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_530_1#1$1","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"研究员","text":"什么……","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_530_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"从现在开始，园区警卫队将接手莱茵对生态园的管辖权，进行全方位的事故调查，在取证完成之前所有人都不准靠近设备！","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"警卫队。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":200},{"type":"charslot","id":201},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"0.3","isblock":"true","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"0.3","isblock":"true","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","duration":"0.3","isblock":"true","id":205},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫队","text":"在。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"封锁生态园。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"200,0","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫队","text":"是。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":215},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":219},{"type":"charslot","id":220},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":223},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"抱歉，娜斯提主任，我为你们夭折的实验成果感到痛心，但为园区的安全考虑，我必须做这个决定。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"直到事故调查结果出来之前，你的研究员需要全部撤出实验室，检修工作我也会派别人处理。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"那些警卫什么时候等在门外的，警报响起之前，还是之后？","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"我不知道你在说什么。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我会让研究员离开，但我不会走。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"高登，你来得太巧了。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"……","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":239},{"type":"dialog","id":240},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":241},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":242},{"type":"charslot","id":243},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_bg_68_g14_corridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":244},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":245},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":247},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":248},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","id":249,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"呼……呼……","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"他们……没追上来……太好了……","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#7$1","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"对不起，高登长官，本来应该等您来生态园找我们会合的，但我食言了。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"我想，我已经找到能帮助那位女妖客人的东西了……","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":258},{"type":"charslot","id":259},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":260},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":261},{"type":"subtitle","text":"费尔南摊开紧握的右手，一支通体白色的物体被她托在手心。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":262},{"type":"subtitle","text":"十分钟前，她在生态园一边参观，一边琢磨究竟什么能帮助一名年迈的女妖恢复神志。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":263},{"type":"subtitle","text":"她知道，那必须是一件对女妖而言非常重要的东西，能唤起本能的东西。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":264},{"type":"subtitle","text":"如命运一般，这根插在树上的小东西闯入了费尔南的视线。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":265},{"type":"subtitle","text":"晦涩的符号遍布莹白的“短枝”，四周飘浮的纹路如泛着微光的心电图波形，透露出不可抗拒的吸引力。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":266},{"type":"subtitle","text":"费尔南见过类似的符号和纹路——这是一支属于女妖的骨笔。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":267},{"type":"subtitle","id":268},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"抱歉，娜斯提主任，暂且借用一下您的骨笔，等我的客人恢复健康，我就马上把它还回去。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":273},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":274},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":275},{"type":"charslot","id":276},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_bg_hotel.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":277},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":278},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":279},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":280},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#2$1","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"嘿，我亲爱的客人，整天闷在房间里真的委屈您啦，我想我找到让您找回记忆的方法了——","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"呃……客人？","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":286},{"type":"charslot","id":287},{"type":"text","text":"房间里空无一人，只有床单上的褶皱证明曾有人来过。","id":288},{"type":"text","text":"风从大开的窗户吹进房间，窗台上，一枚黑色的羽角残片微微晃动。","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"她……不见了……","id":290},{"type":"dialog","id":291},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":293},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":294},{"type":"charslot","id":295},{"type":"background","id":296},{"type":"image","id":297}],"characters":["费尔南","娜斯提","梅希亚","？？？","高登","研究员","园区警卫队"]}